een transformed into a perverted horse from Dragon quest with hairy armpits and crotch.\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/798681288356921374/926938486358048788/boggy_femsona_3.png", "nc": 171, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@4Balaclava/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 486902, "client_id": 654896, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ededa82b/uploads/origins/8ce6e2ec-3cb6-4a07-8ef0-b69e9c7d905f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=231b726b1726d01021ef6117bc4ee6ff", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ededa82b/uploads/origins/8ce6e2ec-3cb6-4a07-8ef0-b69e9c7d905f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=00c0d1cf643d3770d77746fae78e6c07", "src_set": ""}, "body": "May I ask for an R-18 illustration of \"Sister Claire\" from \"Virtual Youtuber\"?\nI'd be very happy if you could keep the following two points in mind.\nAn evil expression.\nThe hair and clothes should be original to some extent so that the original character can be easily recognized.\nThe hair and clothes should be original to a certain extent so that the original character can be easily recognized. (You can keep everything original or arrange it wickedly.)", "nc": 33, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@4Balaclava/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 486902, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6b9307b/uploads/origins/bb2b5519-3701-4380-8fe7-15c9cd7db5e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a097e635fdd83c1650cfc70de4621eb8", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": true, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6b9307b/uploads/origins/bb2b5519-3701-4380-8fe7-15c9cd7db5e1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=344de38da7a25620978d70d383b84863", "src_set": ""}, "body": "I would like to request a color image of Rikku in her thief outfit from Final Fantasy X-2 after she's begun to transform into a hybrid Malboro (a monster from the final fantasy series) creature. Her skin is pale green, and she's beginning to sprout small tentacles and eye stalks on her body like the monster. Her mouth is starting to widen and she's developing the monster's fangs.  She's still got a humanoid figure, and the transformation has been making her fat; she's around 50kg heavier than her starting design.  To show that Rikku is developing a Malboro's Bad Breath status ailment abilities, she's developing poisonous looking body odor from her underarms that infects the air around her. She looks pleased and content, and is flirtatiously releasing a toxic 'Bad Breath' belch, excited at the prospect of spreading the Malboro spores that have infected her to others. (No other characters need to be drawn into the image). \n\nThank you very much for reading!", "nc": 58, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@4Balaclava/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fce400e5/uploads/origins/61254c02-b2e1-4c75-8ba2-4cc13b727bde?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=58fb5df3f121504e36e3dfd37790ac49", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 486902, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@4Balaclava/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 486902, "client_id": 149457, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74fd9d1d/uploads/origins/008f4120-ff1d-489e-9fe1-b64bf98b3363?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a94b29df7da84ccdc7753b620f4efe33", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/74fd9d1d/uploads/origins/008f4120-ff1d-489e-9fe1-b64bf98b3363?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4d4d7979be047d174f80b0b1a681604b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "I'm requesting an IF situation of Mai Shiranui's previous transformation into a meat pisser in a state change illustration.\nA situation where Morrigan-san's punishment fails and the two of them are turned into urinals side by side.\nI'd like to see a color version of the frontal cut where they're lined up, and I'd like to see a state change where they're completely in the shape of a urinal like the previous change.", "nc": 49, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@4Balaclava/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 486902, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/42302d5b/requests/188875_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3cac664a6de6e16914d43b2305a2a7ef", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/42302d5b/requests/188875_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=121feb16e9725f37e152b4f7a45a2018", "src_set": ""}, "body": "初めまして、楽しく拝見しています。\nダンジョン飯のマルシルのオーク化をお願いしたいです。容姿:ダンジョン飯のメスオークを太らせたぐらい。服装:オーク化で破けて一部だけ身体に乗っかって残ってる感じ。シチュ:オークになった事で変わった体臭を豚のような鼻で嗅いで恍惚とした表情をしている感じです。　何とぞよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@4Balaclava/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a42cf746/requests/198133_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=edacf6bed69ba4053e10f849e49dfb4c", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 486902, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 48, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@4Balaclava/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 486902, "client_id": 88832, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1dc0afab/requests/86323_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=957e0ea6d991f7381544e5af094676b4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1dc0afab/requests/86323_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=588a60cdf1dbc2d56ac6723d2882fece", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Nice to meet you, I am always looking forward to seeing you.\nAfter seeing the illustration of Mai Shiranui who became obese, I really wanted to see it with other characters.\nTherefore, I think that it was drawn before, but please change the flora of Dragon Quest 5 to gas dango.\nThe gas dango-like flora spreads gas from the body and is held happily by Gema.\n\nThank you for your understanding.", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, 